[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5482349828","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123042#issuecomment-5482349828","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123042","id":5482349828,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRsYFBA","user":{"login":"jgyo","id":2886615,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4ODY2MTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2886615?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgyo","html_url":"https://github.com/jgyo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgyo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgyo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgyo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgyo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgyo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgyo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgyo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgyo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgyo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-31T17:58:16Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T17:58:16Z","body":"This problem is worse than I described before. The apparent recursion within the property appears to occur whether or not the specified index is out of bounds when a breakpoint is added on the line where the array is accessed. I changed the MRP to the following and set a breakpoint on line eight.\n\n```gdscript\nextends Control\n\nconst OUT_OF_BOUNDS_INDEX = 10\nvar test_array: Array[int] = []\n\nvar property: int = 0:\n\tget:\n\t\treturn test_array[OUT_OF_BOUNDS_INDEX]\n\nfunc  _ready() -> void:\n\ttest_array.resize(100)\n\tvar test : int = property\n```\n\nWhen I ran the code in the debugger, it entered the same infinite loop as before, with the line appearing multiple times in the stack trace. However, if there is no breakpoint on that line, the problem is not reproduced.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5482349828/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5494339275","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123042#issuecomment-5494339275","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123042","id":5494339275,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABR3z2yw","user":{"login":"aguneyaltun","id":47734769,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzM0NzY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47734769?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aguneyaltun","html_url":"https://github.com/aguneyaltun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aguneyaltun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aguneyaltun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aguneyaltun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aguneyaltun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aguneyaltun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aguneyaltun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aguneyaltun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aguneyaltun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aguneyaltun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-01T13:01:30Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T13:03:33Z","body":"Bisected this to dc5c2f5b750aec8f925f0c6bf7cf9611e2438693 (PR #94096) which adds a call to _object_selected() in EditorDebuggerInspector::add_stack_variable\n\nAlso reproducible on [5ec4857b3] \n\nTested with the MRP from the OP on Linux, built with \nscons platform=linuxbsd target=editor use_llvm=yes scu_build=yes \n\n- Parent commit: the out-of-bounds error is reported and the editor stays responsive.\n- At dc5c2f5b, the stack trace refreshes repeatedly, flickering and the editor stops responding to input.\n\nI haven't investigated beyond the bisect. \n\ncc @matheusmdx \n\n[bisect-123042.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31692942/bisect-123042.txt)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5494339275/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5495715437","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123042#issuecomment-5495715437","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123042","id":5495715437,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABR5H2bQ","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-01T14:43:39Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T14:43:39Z","body":"I can confirm the issue. The problem happens when the editor hit a breakpoint inside a `get` function, so the MRP can be simplified to this:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Control\n\nvar property:\n\tget:\n\t\treturn property # Put the breakpoint here\n\nfunc  _ready() -> void:\n\tproperty\n\n```\n\nThe engine keeps calling the `get` function nonstop after hit the breakpoint and only closing the running game stops it.\n\n<br>\n\nAs i explained in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/94096 i just created the PR, but the code isn't mine, so i don't have enough knowledge to properly fix it. Pinging @YeldhamDev and @Mickeon ([seems that you intuition was correct](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/94096#issuecomment-2217953195)) to give a better insight about this issue.\n\nAlso, YeldhamDev mentions [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/94096#issuecomment-4653509695) this code was part of the engine and changed at some point, so i tested the MRP with Godot 3.6.3 / 3.7 dev 1 and the issue is also reproducible there:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72128d9a-e7d1-4f93-9190-8e0f75b8f5c4","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5495715437/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5517537446","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123042#issuecomment-5517537446","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123042","id":5517537446,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSN7wpg","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-02T22:52:20Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T16:43:12Z","body":"The reason seems to be a feedback loop caused by selecting the node with the breakpoint script (which cant fully accomplish, as it can't finish parsing the script due to the break being in the getter), which makes the remote add to the stack trace, which causes the node to be selected again, and so on.\n\nOne can technically reproduce this even if the line from the PR is removed, by clicking the node with the script over and over, each time will add to the stack.\n\nI'm not sure what the best approach would be to stop this. The debugger would need to somehow know this will happen and stop selecting the node.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5517537446/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5529514598","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123042#issuecomment-5529514598","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123042","id":5529514598,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSZWyZg","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T17:25:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T17:25:46Z","body":"I wonder if this could be related https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122339 , remote inspector always calls getters continuously even when paused, so any error in the getter will get spammed, infinite loop is new yeah. And breakpoint in getter seems to be really egregious too","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5529514598/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5530007408","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123042#issuecomment-5530007408","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123042","id":5530007408,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSZ03cA","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T18:06:55Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T18:07:26Z","body":"They both seem to share the core issue. But we should still be able to get an object's values while paused, as this is a huge feature for convenience when debugging.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5530007408/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5530833059","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123042#issuecomment-5530833059","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123042","id":5530833059,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSanQow","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T19:13:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T19:13:53Z","body":"Since I got mentioned, I do feel compelled to reply. But, genuinely, I can't possibly think of any easy solution. It's sounding like the Halting Problem.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5530833059/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5531814464","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123042#issuecomment-5531814464","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123042","id":5531814464,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSbjKQA","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T20:37:26Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T21:24:32Z","body":"Can we not enter into breakpoint if the game is paused? Or is this change in behaviour too large? Also need to check if this actually works as a workaround for this issue. Also this still would do nothing for the error spam, huh... well seeing that getter does get run each new error is an actual new error, so just removing them is also wrong.\n\nIdeally we could somehow not trigger breakpoints if the caller is editor inspector, but I'm struggling to imagine how it could even be achieved","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5531814464/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5704133712","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123042#issuecomment-5704133712","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123042","id":5704133712,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABU_4sUA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-16T20:35:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T20:35:35Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.8.dev 97dab7a63 (Linux).\n\n> Godot v4.8.dev (97dab7a63) - Fedora Linux 44 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor (3840x2160 @ 240.02 Hz) - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 610.57.04) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/973aaed5-8cf0-494f-9f58-af76f6ebb048\n\nThe project crashes after reaching the breakpoint 68 times (consistent across launches).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5704133712/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5808826464","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123042#issuecomment-5808826464","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123042","id":5808826464,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWjuoYA","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T06:18:18Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T06:18:18Z","body":"Something similar still happens on master v4.8.dev.custom_build [ca871ccc9] if you manually select the object in the remote inspector. Also after selecting the object the game is now impossible to resume.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18b40be2-58da-405e-88a3-b34d36c7dc48\n\nSelecting it once is enough to get it stuck.\n\nIn `RemoteDebugger::debug` inside the `while` loop it enters `RemoteDebugger::debug` again from the `getter`, resuming the game only exits the inner debug loop, so now it is stuck in the outer `while` loop, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123173\n\nHmm, after some testing it seems like if you toggle `Break` and `Continue (F12)` in the debugger enough times you can resume it.\n\n<img width=\"1229\" height=\"298\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d553b87b-cd0c-4198-88c1-3517a618238f\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5808826464/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]